          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>First $S_{xx}$: $\\bar x=\\frac{5+6.5+8+4+8.5}{5}=\\frac{32}{5}=6.4$; deviations $-1.4,\\ 0.1,\\ 1.6,\\ -2.4,\\ 2.1$; squares $1.96+0.01+2.56+5.76+4.41=14.70$. Then $se(\\hat\\beta_{1})=\\frac{\\hat\\sigma}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}}}=\\frac{1.66}{\\sqrt{14.70}}=\\frac{1.66}{3.8341}=0.4330$. Hence $t=\\frac{\\hat\\beta_{1}-0}{se(\\hat\\beta_{1})}=\\frac{0.39}{0.4330}=0.90$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Trước hết tính $S_{xx}$: $\\bar x=\\frac{5+6{,}5+8+4+8{,}5}{5}=\\frac{32}{5}=6{,}4$; độ lệch $-1{,}4;\\ 0{,}1;\\ 1{,}6;\\ -2{,}4;\\ 2{,}1$; bình phương $1{,}96+0{,}01+2{,}56+5{,}76+4{,}41=14{,}70$. Khi đó $se(\\hat\\beta_{1})=\\frac{\\hat\\sigma}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}}}=\\frac{1{,}66}{\\sqrt{14{,}70}}=\\frac{1{,}66}{3{,}8341}=0{,}4330$. Vậy $t=\\frac{\\hat\\beta_{1}-0}{se(\\hat\\beta_{1})}=\\frac{0{,}39}{0{,}4330}=0{,}90$.</p></div>"
